{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "177", "x": 0.8963582418733852, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037385006730250595, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "us that in the same year all the clubs decided to set a limit of 90 minutes for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.7715658420892207, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "each match. Before that it was a more casual arrangement and this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7717485415569009, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sometimes caused huge arguments and sometimes fights during matches", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7715654319894055, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "when one team called the end of the game and the other team wanted to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7711084782702974, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "play on to try and score a winning goal. By 1878, the number of teams in the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7721962680301665, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "football league increased again. In addition, referees started using whistles", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7714566530134186, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and electric lamps were installed on certain pitches. This was a significant", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7715001235938318, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "change as games could then be played in the evenings all year round. In", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1880, clubs began to charge fans for admission to games, even though", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7716290999857183, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "players were still amateurs and had other proper jobs. That's hard to imagine", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7716089025698187, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in the modern professional game where top players earned significant sums", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7716092101446801, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of money from both playing and commercial activities.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.5544501827661089, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}